Changes and third-party material
--------------------------------
- Episode classifications were derived from the local `anime_filler.md` range
  list. Its origin, revision and license are still unpinned; see
  ATTRIBUTION.md.
- MAL and TMDB identifiers were resolved with AniList title search and
  Fribb/anime-lists. Ids are factual identifiers; upstream terms are under
  review.
- No Anime Filler List (AFL) HTML and no SkipTheFiller page content is included.
- Pictorium's existing anime filler snapshot is a separate artifact under
  CC BY 4.0 and is not merged into this database.

